{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23186","headline":"萧相公宅遇自远禅师有感而赠 · 白居易","name":"萧相公宅遇自远禅师有感而赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宦途堪笑不胜悲，昨日荣华今日衰。\n转似秋蓬无定处，长於春梦几多时。\n半头白发慙萧相，满面红尘问远师。\n应是世间缘未尽，欲抛官去尚迟疑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23186.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23186","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}